# ============================================================================
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
#
# Everything tracked here is source. No file that carries real data about a
# project, a person, a cost or a Jira issue may ever be committed, and the
# audit of 2026-09-16 confirmed none ever has.
#
# These patterns exist because that was previously guaranteed only by
# discipline: testing the Jira mirror means putting a real 550 KB export next
# to index.html so the page can fetch it, and it was deleted by hand before
# every commit. `git add -A` one time before that delete and real issue
# titles, assignee names and email addresses would be in a public repository,
# in a commit, forever.
#
# A rule costs nothing. Remembering costs everything, once.
# ============================================================================

# Jira mirror, filter, change sets and their results — real issue data
gfx-jira-mirror*.json
gfx-jira-changes*.json
gfx-jira-result*.json
gfx-jira-queue*.json
gfx-jira-filter*.json

# app exports and backups — real roster, costs, tasks
gfx-prod-app-backup*.json
gfx-backup-*.json
*.xlsx
*.xlsm

# anything staged for a test, by the convention that it starts with _tmp or _
_tmp*
_fsa-*
_probe*

# credentials, in any shape
*.secret
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.token

# the usual noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
~$*
